                "message": "perf(toxav): optimize video encoding performance and latency\n\n- Reuse `vpx_image_t` buffer in `VCSession` to eliminate malloc/free\n  overhead for every encoded frame.\n- Enable `VP8E_SET_TOKEN_PARTITIONS` (trying 8, falling back to 4) to\n  allow multi-threaded encoding.\n- Increase maximum encoder and decoder threads from 4 to 8 to make more\n  use of multi-core CPUs.\n- Switch `rc_end_usage` from `VPX_VBR` to `VPX_CBR`. While VBR offers\n  better quality-to-size ratio, CBR provides more predictable network\n  traffic, lower latency, and better security properties.\n- Set `VP8E_SET_STATIC_THRESHOLD` to 1 to reduce CPU usage on static\n  parts of the video frame.\n\n| Benchmark | Master (ns) | Video-Opt (ns) | Speedup |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `VideoBench/EncodeSequence/320/240` | 688,146 | 578,916 | **1.19x** |\n| `VideoBench/EncodeSequence/640/480` | 2,490,222 | 1,955,266 | **1.27x** |\n| `VideoBench/EncodeSequence/1280/720` | 7,122,754 | 5,638,422 | **1.26x** |\n| `VideoBench/EncodeSequence/1920/1080` | 15,230,036 | 12,198,499 | **1.25x** |\n| `VideoBench/DecodeSequence/320/240` | 74,371 | 79,684 | 0.93x |\n| `VideoBench/DecodeSequence/640/480` | 242,421 | 163,832 | **1.48x** |\n| `VideoBench/DecodeSequence/1280/720` | 749,517 | 322,894 | **2.32x** |\n| `VideoBench/DecodeSequence/1920/1080` | 1,747,054 | 703,976 | **2.48x** |\n| `VideoBench/FullSequence/320/240` | 873,665 | 670,249 | **1.30x** |\n| `VideoBench/FullSequence/640/480` | 2,917,369 | 2,136,498 | **1.37x** |\n| `VideoBench/FullSequence/1280/720` | 8,498,718 | 6,107,803 | **1.39x** |\n| `VideoBench/FullSequence/1920/1080` | 18,513,932 | 13,873,525 | **1.33x** |",
